   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «Rabbi Shimon said: Any» vegetables «that the» owner of the «upper» garden «can stretch out» his hand and take, those vegetables are his, and the rest belong to the owner of the lower garden. In «the school of Rabbi Yannai they say: And» this is only so «provided that he does not force» himself, but simply stretches out his hand in the usual manner."
